            "review_title": "Review at Tiem Chi Ba",
            "review_text": "bedforone\nSingapore, Singapore596 contributions\n0\nDelicious Food + Kombucha\nApr 2023 • Solo\nstumbled upon this li’l store in an alley way- was attracted by the banners on the wall. ordered a Bun Cha Gio for 35,000vnd and enjoyed it! spring rolls were crispy and good. lady doesn’t really speak english but just point at what you want and all’s good. \n\nfor drinks, a kombucha menu was provided. didn’t know what they were so went with the gut and ordered a random drink. nice to have a refreshing option apart from the usual coffees. i recommend if you’re in the area\nRead more\nWritten April 19, 2023",
